Usage: ambit [options] [command]

a deterministic dependency manager for AI-agent capabilities

Options:
  --version                        print the ambit version
  --help                           show usage

Commands:
  export [options]                 export selected packs as Claude plugins
  init [options]                   scaffold ambit.yml, skills/, mcps/, hooks/
  search [options] <pattern>       search the merged catalog
  resolve [options]                compute the bundle and print it
  why [options] <kind:name>        explain why one item is in the bundle
  install [options]                resolve, write lock, materialize, prune
  status [options]                 compare what is installed against what
                                   resolve produces
  outdated [options]               check whether any catalog's ref now names a
                                   different commit
  update [options] [catalog...]    move catalog pins forward, then install
  prune [options]                  remove owned artifacts not in the current
                                   bundle
  clean [options]                  remove everything ambit owns
  validate [options]               validate everything this project configures,
                                   for CI
  doctor [options]                 check preconditions, drift, ownership
  self-update [options] [version]  replace this ambit binary with a released one
